  "notes": "Historical material/card import retained as provenance; the inherited hkl/d/intensity array is superseded and preserved privately with its full original document. The present peaks are independent kinematic X-ray calculations (0.8-20 A, sum multiplicity*|F|^2, maximum 100), not measured intensities or a recovered source-card selection. COD 1566661 is the cited Besson deuterated ice VIII structure at 2.8 GPa / 296 K. Reference cell retained. These are X-ray electron-scattering intensities, not neutron intensities; D has the H form factor. Original scientific EOS evidence, observations and applicability limits are unchanged.",
